entityDescription:
AER provides mechanical, electromechanical and thermal customized solutions with unfaltering operability in tough environments.

AER's core business involves designing, proving, manufacturing, testing, deploying, maintaining and dismantling industrial assemblies and subassemblies.

From creative ideas to end-of-life expertise, AER offers a range of bespoke technical solutions and technologies for its customers¿ applications.

AER designs and manufactures specific products based on stringent technical requirements:
- ultra high vacuum;
- very low magnetism;
- adapted to cesium;
- thermal behavior;
- high precision proportional valve;
- harsh environments (vibration, shocks etc.).

AER meets customers¿ technical specifications for instrumentation, specific tools or benches.

This activity involves mechanical functions like machinery, scientific and precision instruments, safe mechanical handling equipment etc.

AER develops this kind of specific products in Aerospace, Defense, Railways, Medical and Energy applications.





AER designs complex and secure processing and containment systems:
- trapping ¿ handling hydrogen;
- sorting and capturing of radioactive gaseous effluents.
